*.png
src/vcfdist
src/test

# ignore analysis
analysis/*/*/
analysis-v2/*/*/
analysis-v2/hla

# ignore input/output
data/
out/

# don't track test cases
test/
issues/

# Per-harness duplicate instruction files; AGENTS.md is canonical here and
