COPILOT_INSTRUCTIONS.md
GEMINI.md
GEMINI_INSTRUCTIONS.md
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules

# Alternative agent-doc conventions not used in this repo.
SKILL.md
RULES.md
CONTEXT.md
